Exceptions (third-party code)
-----------------------------
The plugin is built on exlaunch (https://github.com/shadowninja108/exlaunch),
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0. exlaunch itself is not
included in this repository. The following files replace exlaunch files at
build time and are adapted from them; they remain under GPL-2.0:
  - plugin/overlay/config.mk
  - plugin/overlay/source/lib/log/svc_logger.cpp
Compiled plugin binaries (subsdk9) statically include exlaunch and are
therefore distributed under the terms of GPL-2.0.

This repository contains no game assets. The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the
Wild is a trademark of Nintendo; this project is not affiliated with Nintendo.
